Depends: libc6 (>= 2.43), libasound2t64, libfontconfig1, libgcc-s1, libgl1, libgtk-3-0t64, libudev1, libusb-1.0-0, libwayland-client0, libwayland-cursor0, libwayland-egl1, libx11-6, libxcursor1, libxi6, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxkbcommon0, libxrandr2
Homepage: https://github.com/sp6ina/SPLogbook
Description: Amateur radio logging and station automation workstation
 SPLogbook is a desktop application for amateur radio operators. It provides
 QSO logging, ADIF and Cabrillo import and export, contest and award tracking,
 DX cluster connectivity, propagation and satellite tools, CAT control and
 audio recording.
 .
 This package installs the system-wide application below /opt/SPLogbook,
 a command launcher at /usr/bin/splogbook and desktop integration files.
 It does not install, modify or remove user data, QSO databases or
 configuration stored in the XDG directories.
